Scale hint: predicted conversion probabilities are tiny (mean around `traffic.current_pvalue_mean`, typically 1e-4 to 1e-3) while winning market prices are around 0.1-1.0 per impression, so competitive alpha values are typically in the tens to low hundreds. Watch `market.recent_win_rate`: if it stays 0 your alpha is too low to win anything.

Respond with ONLY a JSON object:
{"action": "set_alpha", "alpha": <number>, "confidence": <0..1>, "reason_code": "<SHORT_UPPER_SNAKE_REASON>"}

